      en: ["The building was constructed between 1904 and 1906.", "It was originally opened as the Hohenzollern Hotel.", "The statue of Atlas on the roof is its most prominent feature.", "The building has been a protected national monument since 1972.", "The facade features elaborate Neo-Baroque plasterwork.", "Today, the building is primarily used for residential apartments."],
